---
// Engines strip: "Same code. Bring your own engine."
---

<section style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surf)">
  <div class="wrap" style="padding:clamp(28px,11vw,56px) var(--gutter);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(340px,100%),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:center">
    <div>
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:34px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.01em">Same code. Bring your own engine.</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;color:var(--mute);max-width:440px">
        Neo4j Community, Enterprise or Aura. Or Relate, embedded in-process with
        <code style="color:var(--text)">Neode.forRelate()</code> and compiled to WebAssembly, which is why the
        playground needs no server.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(200px,100%),1fr));gap:12px">
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;background:var(--bg)"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:20px">Neo4j</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--mute)">Community · Enterprise</div></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;background:var(--bg)"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:20px">Aura</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--mute)">managed Neo4j</div></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--blue);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;background:var(--bg)"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:var(--blue)">Relate</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--mute)">embedded · WASM</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
